        "content": "<p>bjorn3 opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/15057\">issue #15057</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<h3><code>.clif</code> Test Case</h3>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"k\">use</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">std</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">arch</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">aarch64</span><span class=\"p\">::</span><span class=\"n\">uint64x1_t</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"k\">pub</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">fn</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">lane</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">_a</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">u8</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">b</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">uint64x1_t</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">-&gt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">uint64x1_t</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">b</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3>Steps to Reproduce</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Compile with cg_clif</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Expected Results</h3>\n<p><code>b</code> is passed in a vector register.</p>\n<h3>Actual Results</h3>\n<p><code>b</code> is passed in an integer register as <code>I64.by(1)</code> returns <code>i64</code> as type rather than a <code>i64x1</code> vector type.</p>\n<h3>Versions and Environment</h3>\n<p>Cranelift version or commit: 0.137</p>\n<p>Operating system: Linux</p>\n<p>Architecture: arm64</p>\n<h3>Extra Info</h3>\n<p>Originally reported at <a href=\"https://github.com/rust-lang/rustc_codegen_cranelift/issues/1718\">https://github.com/rust-lang/rustc_codegen_cranelift/issues/1718</a></p>\n</blockquote>",
